(text "POWER - fan path is metered and has its own ground back to the star point" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "68354c80-e1f3-5ee4-be02-c3731e1ab794"))
(text "BATTERY - regulated 5 V (power bank, 4x NiMH) - SS34 blocks reverse polarity and USB back-feed" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 104.14 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8cf8bd4f-ac80-55e9-b3d0-c8808a678efa"))
(text "ESP32 DevKit V1 (30-pin) - sockets for the DevKit" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f242da9a-db17-50b0-aaaa-5c75d4ab40e2"))
(text "Notes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 215.9 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "31dc1594-bb0a-516d-84c8-2f2a281e71e1"))
(text "1. Each module VCC jumper: cap on 5V+VCC = 5 V, cap on VCC+3V3 = 3.3 V. Defaults: TEMP on 5V, the rest on 3V3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 221 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f1423eaa-427e-5c1e-850a-809aff6c607d"))
(text "2. Every signal goes through a series resistor and a BAT54S clamp, so a 5 V module cannot lift a GPIO above ~3.6 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 224.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c34e9c86-2cf8-508f-b32c-e264269b2a65"))
(text "3. Wattmeter I2C goes through a BSS138 level shifter, so the SEN0291 may run on 5 V or 3V3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ee9650e6-7d40-5d52-98b1-f1570ef66706"))
(text "4. The fan takes 5 V only through the wattmeter (IN+ -> IN-). Close BYPASS only if the wattmeter is not fitted." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 232.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "98339115-f4d5-5719-8d2b-06c954d9eae7"))
(text "5. Fan ground (GND_FAN) joins logic GND only at NT1, next to the DevKit GND pin (star ground)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 236.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4ff324a3-b432-5231-9a6e-20bc30ac7ba2"))
(text "6. Sensor 5 V (+5V_S) is filtered from VIN by FB1, so fan noise stays off the sensor rail." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 240 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "64fc1481-bd78-522f-956b-d2a20978783b"))
(text "Author: Mohamed Khamis" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 246.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "37f9d6d7-1705-5e0f-9718-7bdad86a45c8"))
